{{ 'section-rich-text.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="dr-policy-page page-width">
  <div class="dr-policy-hero">
    <div class="dr-policy-hero__badge">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
      Your Privacy
    </div>
    <h1 class="dr-policy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="dr-policy-subtitle">At Dr. Romelia, we respect and protect your personal information and privacy.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="dr-policy-body rte">
    <h2>1. Overview</h2>
    <p>This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Dr. Romelia</strong> ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and discloses your personal information when you visit or make a purchase from <strong>drromelia.com</strong>.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you visit our store or make a purchase, we collect necessary information including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Name, shipping address, billing address, phone number, and email address.</li>
      <li><strong>Order Details:</strong> Items purchased, payment method (such as Cash on Delivery), and order history.</li>
      <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> IP address, browser type, and cookies to ensure a smooth browsing experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your personal data to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Process, fulfill, and deliver your orders anywhere in Pakistan.</li>
      <li>Communicate with you regarding order updates, tracking, and customer support.</li>
      <li>Send promotional offers, discounts, and skincare advice (if opted in).</li>
      <li>Improve and optimize our website and user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
    <p>We only share your information with trusted third-party service providers essential to running our business, such as courier delivery partners (e.g., TCS, Leopards, Trax) to deliver your parcels safely to your doorstep. We <strong>never</strong> sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We implement strict security measures to protect your personal data against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about our privacy practices, please contact us:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:dr.romeliaskincare@gmail.com">dr.romeliaskincare@gmail.com</a></li>
      <li><strong>Location:</strong> Pakistan</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

